{"chapter":"a1-35-goethe4","level":"A1","number":35,"title":"Goethe Mini 4","rows":[{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":1,"text":"Ich habe einen Reisebericht geschrieben Willst du ihn lesen","speaker":"Runa","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"a1-35-goethe4","level":"A1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":2,"text":"Ja gern War die Reise wirklich so schön","speaker":"Nick","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"a1-35-goethe4","level":"A1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":3,"text":"Tatsächlich war sie super Ich habe das Meer gesehen","speaker":"Runa","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"a1-35-goethe4","level":"A1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":4,"text":"Und was hast du gern gemocht","speaker":"Nick","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"a1-35-goethe4","level":"A1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":5,"text":"Ich habe das Meer sehr gemocht","speaker":"Runa","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"a1-35-goethe4","level":"A1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":6,"text":"Wirklich Bist du geschwommen","speaker":"Nick","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"a1-35-goethe4","level":"A1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":7,"text":"Ja oft Aber das Wasser war sehr kalt","speaker":"Runa","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"a1-35-goethe4","level":"A1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":8,"text":"Das glaube ich Aber das klingt immer noch toll","speaker":"Nick","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"a1-35-goethe4","level":"A1"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":9,"text":"Es war toll Nächstes Jahr komme ich noch einmal","speaker":"Runa","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"a1-35-goethe4","level":"A1"},{"section":"vocabulary","type"